insert into public.lessons (id, topic_id, unit_id, title, body_md, minutes, sort_order) overriding system value values
(1, 1, 1, 'Overview & setup', 'Every lesson on Primer follows the same rhythm: a short explanation, a worked example, and an exercise to prove it stuck.

## The idea

**Overview & setup** is one step in *Introduction to HTML*. Work through it in order — each lesson builds on the one before it.

## Try it yourself

- Apply the idea to a small example of your own.
- Explain it out loud in one sentence; if you can''t, reread the section above.
- Note one question to bring to the next lesson.

## What to remember

1. Small steps, in order, beat big leaps.
2. Practice is the point — reading alone doesn''t stick.
3. Mark the lesson complete when you can do it, not just follow it.', 14, 1),
